Sport: {{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.sport }}
Activity: {{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.activityName }}
Device: {{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.device }}
Duration: {{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.durationMin }}min moving ({{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.elapsedMin }}min elapsed)
{{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.sport === 'Swim' ? 'Distance: ' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.distanceM + 'm' : 'Distance: ' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.distanceKm + 'km' }}
Pace: {{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.pace || 'N/A' }}
Cadence: {{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.cadence || 'N/A' }}{{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.cadenceCV ? ' (variability: ' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.cadenceCV + ')' : '' }}

{{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.avgPower ? '=== POWER ===\nAverage: ' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.avgPower + 'W\nNormalized: ' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.normalizedPower + 'W\nMax: ' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.maxPower + 'W\nVariability Index: ' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.variabilityIndex : '' }}

{{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.avgHR ? '=== HEART RATE ===\nAverage: ' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.avgHR + 'bpm\nMax: ' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.maxHR + 'bpm\nZone distribution (Z1→Z5+): ' + ($('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.hrZoneMins ? $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.hrZoneMins.join(', ') + ' min' : 'N/A') : '' }}

=== COMPUTED METRICS ===
Cardiac Drift: {{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.cardiacDrift || 'N/A' }}
{{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.powerDecoupling ? 'Power Decoupling: ' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.powerDecoupling : '' }}
{{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.paceDecoupling ? 'Pace Decoupling: ' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.paceDecoupling : '' }}

=== TRAINING LOAD ===
TSS: {{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.tss || 'N/A' }}
Intensity Factor: {{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.intensityFactor || 'N/A' }}

{{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.intervals ? '=== INTERVALS (' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.intervalCount + ' work reps) ===\n' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.intervals.join('\n') : '' }}

{{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.ctl ? '=== FITNESS CONTEXT ===\nCTL (fitness): ' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.ctl + '\nATL (fatigue): ' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.atl + '\nTSB (form): ' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.tsb + ($('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.hrv ? '\nHRV: ' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.hrv : '') + ($('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.sleepHours ? '\nSleep: ' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.sleepHours + 'h' : '') + ($('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.restingHR ? '\nResting HR: ' + $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.restingHR + 'bpm' : '') : '' }}

=== INSTRUCTIONS ===
All metrics above are pre-computed from real time-series data. Trust them — do NOT invent or estimate numbers not provided.

Write 6-10 sentences:
1. Infer the session's purpose from the data (endurance / tempo / threshold / intervals / long / recovery) and grade execution A/B/C/F based on whether pacing, intensity, and structure were coherent for that intent. Do NOT compare to a prescribed plan.
2. 2-3 technical insights using the ACTUAL numbers above. Reference pace in the correct unit ({{ $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.sport === 'Swim' ? '/100m' : $('Process & Compute Metrics').item.json.sport === 'Run' ? '/km' : 'km/h' }}).
3. What went well (be specific).
4. One area to improve (actionable, not generic).
5. Context: how this fits the training phase and current fitness/fatigue.
6. What to do tomorrow based on fatigue state.

Rules:
- ONLY reference numbers that appear above. Never fabricate metrics.
- If a metric shows N/A, skip it — don't guess.
- Be direct and coaching-focused. No fluff.
- Tone: demanding but supportive coach.
